      "direction": "soft_pebble",
      "name": "Pebble Soft-Touch Air Quality Detector",
      "form_language": "A smooth, rounded pebble-like enclosure with a continuous soft-touch surface, subtly tapered edges, and a seamless front face. The form is slim and pocketable, with a matte finish that feels premium and warm. A large display window dominates the front, with a discreet intake grille below and a hidden USB-C port on the bottom edge.",
